  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mauyauma Special Harmonization Program for Social and Economic Reincorporation with a Differential Ethnic and Gender Approach in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the development of the prior consultation process of the Special Harmonization Program for social and economic reintegration and reincorporation, with an ethnic and gender focus, and its Normative Instrument for Afro-Colombian, Raizal and Palenquero black communities with the National Prior Consultation Space.The project will deliver the following products:i.Proposal for the Special Harmonization Program and its normative instrument socialized with the ENCP.ii.Methodological document and work plan to advance the Prior Consultation of the Special Harmonization Program and its Regulatory Instrument agreed and developed between the ARN and the ENCP.iii.Special Harmonization Program and its normative instrument socialized with the communities through territorial assemblies and adjusted according to the feedback received from the communities.iv.Special Harmonization Program and its normative instrument approved and formalized in the ENCP</narrative>
  </description>
